  "facts": [
    "shield template AOEDamage uses MAGICAL, atk_scale, useDamageFromBB false and isNoSourceDamage false",
    "two source ATK reads construct scaled and ONE AttackInfo before the first CalculateDamage callback",
    "both calculations enable target events; only the first enables source events",
    "GetFinalAtk is signed64 FP multiply plus atkAddition iff scaleRaw>42950, then Max(0)",
    "magic base uses max(0,100-FPmul(max(0,magicRes-penetrateFixed),1-penetrateRatio)), then FPmul with finalATK and 0.01f, max with 0.05f floor",
    "FP multiply is wrap_signed64((x*y)>>32); negative products round downward",
    "source penetration values are direct FP attributes, not percentages divided by 100; null source baseline uses zero penetration",
    "CalculateDamageNoEvent ordinary magic branch returns Internal result without later factors",
    "CalculateDamage saves result before OnAfterCalculateDamage and returns saved value; originAtk reads first AttackInfo later",
    "AOE radius key is range_radius, default node radius0; scale failed numeric lookup defaults ONE, successful zero retained"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "declarations or independently supplied snapshots, not actual game entities or unchanged callback evidence",
    "current XLua/hotfix, target enumeration, Modifier acceptance, hits/HP and collision/end clocks unknown",
    "late originAtk cannot reuse first Internal input without independent late snapshot or unchanged declaration",
    "legacy float per_hit remains a separate reference, never treated as native full damage"
  ]
